Don't know.  But if you have a really powerful weapon, try a Marilith.  A Marilith
has very many attacks.  I never had to hit any monster twice while being 
a Marilith.

|> 
|> 2) How do i get rid of that damn ball chained to my ankle and that weapon 
|>    welded to my arm?
Try reading a scroll of remove curse.  It will uncurse the weapon (and uncurse
cursed armor too, if you have it.)  I don't know if it will affect the heavy iron ball.  You could also dip the weapon in a potion of holy water.
Find a gelatinous cube (or make one with a wand of create monster) and let it
eat the chain and/or the iron ball.  An iron ball can be useful for getting
away fast.  Just pick up the ball, and throw it.  The ball flies maybe 6-8 steps,
and the chain pulls you with it.  


